 was unhealthy, with 18% of requests failing.\n2. **Approval:** v2.3.2 had never run in production, so policy requires change-manager approval to deploy it. The request was sent to an approver, who approved it (\"Approved. Looks right.\").\n3. **After the deploy:** v2.3.2 is live in all three regions, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n4. **Incident:** INC-0001 records the before and after state and the approval. It names v2.3.0 as the version to roll back to, since it's the last release that was healthy in production. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}